BT 1 0 0 1 0 33 Tm 14.5 TL /F2 10.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Safety:) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf ( never connect an LED without its resistor. The Nano pins are 3.3 V only, so never connect 5 V to a) Tj T* (signal pin. Unplug power and USB when changing wiring. LEDs work one way round: long leg \(+\) toward the) Tj T* (resistor, short leg \(-\) toward the driver. Do not look straight into a lit LED at close range.) Tj T* ET
