BT 1 0 0 1 0 51 Tm 12 TL /F1 9 Tf 0 0 0 rg (This is the complete circuit, drawn in KiCad: the Nano ESP32, the three TBD62083APG driver chips, and the LEDs with their) Tj T* (resistors. ) Tj /F2 9 Tf (To keep it clean, each LED cluster is drawn as one LED and one resistor.) Tj /F1 9 Tf ( In the real build every cluster holds) Tj T* (several LEDs, each with its ) Tj /F2 9 Tf (own resistor) Tj /F1 9 Tf (, and all the cathodes of a cluster join together onto that channel's single driver output) Tj T* (\(Stage 3 shows how one cluster is made\). Hull 1 to 10, the bridge and the hangar bay have 5 LEDs each \(the schematic shows) Tj T* (the bridge with its earlier 2 LEDs\), and each engine has 1. Resistors are 330 ohm for zone LEDs and 220 ohm for engines.) Tj T* ET
