BT 1 0 0 1 0 63 Tm 12 TL /F2 9 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Driver A) Tj /F1 9 Tf ( \(Board 2, turned round\) = Hull 10, Hull 9, Hull 5, Hull 4, Hull 3, Hull 2, Hull 1 and the Bridge \(inputs 1-8: A6, A4, A7, A5,) Tj T* (A3, A0, D12, D10\). ) Tj /F2 9 Tf (Driver B) Tj /F1 9 Tf ( = Accent lights, Hull 6, Hull 7, Hull 8 \(inputs D9, D11, D13, A1; unused inputs 5-8 tied to GND\).) Tj T* /F2 9 Tf (Driver C) Tj /F1 9 Tf ( = Engines 1-7 \(inputs D2-D8\) and the hangar bay \(input 8 from A2, output pin 11\). ) Tj /F2 9 Tf (The schematic above is from the) Tj T* (earlier channel plan:) Tj /F1 9 Tf ( the drivers, Nano and LED wiring are the same, but which Nano pin feeds which zone now follows the) Tj T* (Nano pin allocation page and the Board 2 socket table. Pin 10 \(COMMON\) is left open on every chip, and the Nano is powered) Tj T* (from the +5 V supply through its USB-C pigtail \(VIN is not used\).) Tj T* ET
